    "task": "text-classification",
    "description": "A distilled English classifier fine-tuned on SST-2 movie reviews. It runs locally with Transformers.js and returns ranked positive and negative sentiment probabilities.",
    "intendedUses": [
      "Explore sentiment in short English reviews.",
      "Prototype local sentiment classification.",
      "Benchmark browser text classification."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Only positive and negative labels; neutral and mixed opinions are forced into one class.",
      "Trained on English movie reviews; other languages and domains are not validated.",
      "Sarcasm, negation, missing context and ambiguous text can be misclassified.",
      "Inputs beyond max_length are truncated, potentially dropping relevant sentiment.",
      "Upstream reports demographic/geographic biases; scores are not a reliable measure of a person's emotions or intent.",
      "Require human review before consequential decisions."
    ]
  },
